      ],
      "rationale": "Qiyana is strong in both settings: 52.7% WR in KR solo queue and 57% pro presence. We're taking two small, readable cuts to her burst. Edge of Ixtal base damage goes down by a flat 12 at every rank (70/100/130/160/190 -> 58/88/118/148/178). That lowers her lane trades and early all-ins, which is where her solo queue strength comes from. Supreme Display of Talent base damage drops 10% (100/200/300 -> 90/180/270). That trims the coordinated teamfight and engage burst that drives her pro presence. Her ratios, cooldowns, CC and mobility stay the same, so she plays the same way, just with a bit less burst. Sim: soloq_index -0.70%, pro_index -0.47%, both inside the target bands."
     }
